cts w 48: heights 52/86/120 colors #2E323B / #77C62E / #99EA48, topLeftRadius=topRightRadius=10. counterAxisAlignItems \"MAX\" bottom-aligns. Row counter sizing FIXED height 128: set row.resize(?, 128) with counterAxisSizingMode FIXED... For H layout: primary = horizontal, counter = vertical. height 128 → counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\"; width AUTO (hug of bars).\n\nCaseCard comps: width 410 VERTICAL gap 16:\n- media frame 410x300 r20 bg C.ph, clipsContent — plain frame; inside maybe subtle shapes: skip.\n- caption block (VERTICAL gap 4): caption \"Ai Corporation. 2023\" 14 Medium onDark... wait caption on dark bg: card bg transparent (section dark), text white.\n- title \"Ai Wave - Ai Chatbot Mobile App\" 20 SemiBold white w FILL.\nHover comp: media frame with overlay: plain frame 410x300 r20 clip: child rect 410x300 fill ink 0.5; centered AL pill \"See Details\" white bg ink text pad [10,20] r100 — place at center via constraints center: pill.x=(410-124)/2≈143,y=150-21=129. In plain frame absolute positioning fine. But instance overrides not needed.\n\nVideoBlock comp: 720x440 r24 bg darkCard clip; center: \"HOW WE WORK\" — placed center: text 20 Bold ls 20% white at center y offset -40; play button: 72 circle lime center icon play ink 28 → absolute positions. Add subtle vertical gradient? effects gradient — allowed. I'll add gradient fill: GRADIENT_LINEAR dark #101216→#1B1E25. Fine but optional; keep solid + centered content. Maybe add faint big circle stroke decor: ellipse 320 stroke white 6% — decorative ok.\n\nAbsolute centering: create AL wrapper frame 720x440 VERTICAL main CENTER cross CENTER gap 24 (as the block itself): bg gradient; children: text + play button circle (AL 72x72 center lime with icon). Play: AL frame 72 r100 main/cross CENTER bg lime + icon 26. Good — no absolute math.\n\nTestimonialCard comp: w 880 VERTICAL cross CENTER gap 0:\n- quote text 26 Medium lh 40 ink center, w FILL, textAlignHorizontal CENTER\n- mt 36 row (H gap 16 cross CENTER):