s component\" — done. States: filter selected, card hover, expanded FAQ — done.\n\nOne more check: the brief says navigation items \"each with a dropdown, Icon_Chevron_Down\" — my NavItem has chevron for Service/Agency/Case Study/Resources and hidden for Contact. Good.\n\nAlso \"notifications (Icon_Bell)\" — present in IconButton. Good.\n\nHero stats: progress bar — present. Growth badge — present. Traffic card with 3-bar rising chart — present.\n\nTrusted by: 3 wordmarks — present.\n\nProjects & video: 4 avatars + \"+\" — present. Video placeholder HOW WE WORK + play — present.\n\nTestimonial: all present.\n\nBlog: 3 cards each \"5 min read\" + title + excerpt + arrow chip — present.\n\nFAQ: 4 questions, first expanded — present.\n\nCTA: present.\n\nFooter: present with logo, desc, social, Navigation/Licence/Contact with icons.\n\nEverything covered. Now zoom into a few areas to check details: hero stats card, case row, header. Let me take closer screenshots at higher resolution of specific sections — e.g., the Hero (node \"Hero\") and CaseStudies.\n\nActually, one thing I noticed: in the hero chart card, the bars — first bar looks dark gray and very small, positioned bottom-left; second lime medium; third lime tall. The chart row uses SPACE_BETWEEN with counter MAX (bars aligned bottom). Looks fine.\n\nAlso, the stat card progress bar: track light lime with darker lime fill — visible.\n\nLet me zoom the hero and case studies sections for detail verification.","signature":"93979e41b51d4d8595867e40"}],"id":"f4121c44-782e-4bbb-a751-5a6a9e52df21","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ec9f4e39-381d-40ad-99ab-9aedc1b573bb","uuid":"ed58a8ae-d47f-4a20-97d8-09c5865ece47","timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:13:12.222Z","thinking_duration_ms":33784}
